        <h1 class="highwire-cite-title" id="page-title">Borax-Based Gel Electrophoresis: A Novel Approach for RNA Integrity Analysis</h1>  
      <div  class="highwire-cite-authors" ><span  class="highwire-citation-authors"><span class="highwire-citation-author first hw-author-orcid-logo-wrapper" data-delta="0"><a href="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-7364-6393" target="_blank" class="hw-author-orcid-logo link-icon-only link-icon"><span class="hw-icon-orcid hw-icon-color-orcid"></span> <span class="title element-invisible">View ORCID Profile</span></a><span class="nlm-given-names">Abdulhadi</span> <span class="nlm-surname">Albaser</span></span></span></div>
  
