<div id="hw-article-author-popups-node-4404489--21005384702" style="display: none;"><div class="author-tooltip-0"><div class="author-tooltip-name">Abdulhadi Albaser </div><div class="author-tooltip-affiliation"><span class="author-tooltip-text"><div class='author-affiliation'><span class='nlm-sup'>1</span><span class='nlm-institution'>Department of Microbiology, Faculty of Science, Sebha University</span>, Sebha, <span class='nlm-country'>Libya</span></div></span></div><ul class="author-tooltip-find-more"><li class="author-tooltip-gs-link first"><a href="/lookup/google-scholar?link_type=googlescholar&amp;gs_type=author&amp;author%5B0%5D=Abdulhadi%2BAlbaser%2B" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Find this author on Google Scholar</a></li><li class="author-tooltip-pubmed-link"><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=Albaser%20A&amp;link_type=AUTHORSEARCH" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Find this author on PubMed</a></li><li class="author-site-search-link"><a href="/search/author1%3AAbdulhadi%2BAlbaser%2B" rel="nofollow" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Search for this author on this site</a></li><li class="author-orcid-link"><a href="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-7364-6393" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">ORCID record for Abdulhadi Albaser</a></li><li class="author-corresp-email-link last"><span>For correspondence: 
